# VybeKiit web patterns

Actionable checklist for coding in this template. **SSOT:** `AGENTS.md`. Deep detail:
`.vybekiit/platform-skills/*.md`.

## Contract (every task)

- **Decide + Guide** — you choose all tech; builder gets plain one-step instructions only.
- Read `.vybekiit/agent/session-bootstrap.md` at the start of every task.
- Pick skills via `.vybekiit/agent/goal-index.md` → `.vybekiit/skills/`.
- **Verify-before-advance** after every step. Translate errors; never paste stack traces.
- **No em dashes (`—`)** in buyer-facing copy. UI titles: no em dash, no trailing period or comma. See `language.md` → Tone.
- Never read `.env` values aloud or paste secrets in chat — keys from `.env.example` only.

## Code hygiene

1. **Check before create** — search `src/lib/README.md` and `@vybekiit/*` before new helpers.
2. **One home per concern** — auth → `auth-client.ts`, billing → `billing-client.ts`, logging → `logger.ts`.
3. **Kit logger** — `import { log } from '@/lib/logger'`; no `console.log` in app/API code.
4. **KISS** — no wrappers around kit packages; zod-validate API bodies at route boundaries.
5. **SSOT** — secrets in `.env` only; business constants in one file per domain (e.g. `plans.ts`).

Read: `code-hygiene-vybekiit.md`, `env-secrets-vybekiit.md`.

## UI (web)

- Primitives from `src/components/ui/*` only — no raw `<button>` for standard controls.
- Pick blocks from `.vybekiit/agent/ui-sources.md`; **normalize-on-import** to kit components + `@vybekiit/tokens`.
- Locked sizes: `sm | default | lg | icon`.
- **RTL-ready:** logical spacing (`ms-`, `me-`, `ps-`, `pe-`, `start-`, `end-`); never hard-code `left`/`right`.
- **i18n:** all user-facing strings in `messages/en.json`; use `getTranslations` / `useTranslations` — never inline copy. New keys with new UI. Read `i18n-vybekiit.md`.
- **Mobile-first:** narrow layout first, then `md:`/`lg:`; preview at 375px before calling a page done.

Read: `ui-consistency-vybekiit.md`, `responsive-vybekiit.md`, `shadcn-vybekiit.md`.

## React & Next.js

- Kit hooks: `useAsync`, `useUser`, `useToast`, `FormField` — see `src/hooks/README.md`.
- Keep functions ~5 lines, props ~5; split rather than grow.
- App Router conventions per pinned `vercel-react-best-practices` in `.agents/skills/`.

Read: `react-patterns-vybekiit.md`, `nextjs-vybekiit.md`.

## Quality loop

- Add/update tests with every feature; `pnpm test` green before saying done.
- After substantive edits: `pnpm format && pnpm lint` (or `pnpm verify` before ship).
- Pre-push hook runs quality when the agent pushes — builder never hits it.

Read: `testing-vybekiit.md`, `format-lint-vybekiit.md`.

## Wire-up markers

Unfinished stubs use `TODO(vybekiit): … — skill: <name>`. When builder says "finish setup":

```bash
grep -rn "TODO(vybekiit)" .
```

Run each named skill, replace stub, verify, re-grep until empty. Central stubs:
`src/lib/auth-client.ts`, `src/lib/billing-client.ts`. Never show markers to the builder.

## Observability

- `createLogger` via `src/lib/logger.ts`; optional Sentry via `track-errors` skill.
- Read: `observability-vybekiit.md`, `sentry-vybekiit.md`.
